          "Monitor the ~5.6% demographic gap for immigrant and mixed-race community needs: while small in percentage terms, urban neighborhoods in highly educated districts often concentrate immigrant and mixed-race residents whose concerns around economic mobility, healthcare access, and community safety may be underserved if the incumbent's engagement defaults to the white-majority baseline."
