          "Do not take the 36.2% renter population for granted; renters are a swing constituency in any district and have distinct economic interests in housing costs, lease protections, and wage levels that differ from homeowner priorities — active engagement on these issues can shift persuadable renters from default opposition to genuine consideration.",
          "Address the demographic gap (likely AIAN residents at ~4.36%) with specific constituent attention and authentic partnership where tribal governments or Native American community organizations operate in the district; default neglect of any 4% population segment is a governance failure and a potential vulnerability in a close race.",
