          "Engage the aging constituency (42.2 median age) specifically on healthcare accessibility, Medicare sustainability, and aging-in-place infrastructure—this is the material concern that will dominate household decision-making for the growing share of voters in their 50s and 60s.",
          "Build authentic relationships with the 33.1% college-educated constituency on education funding and school quality; this demographic is responsive to evidence-based governance and will reward a legislator who demonstrates both fiscal responsibility and commitment to education outcomes."
